H6CQ643DZVMXXQKFB", "kind": "note", "text": "Plant the tulip bulbs before the first frost. Move the rosemary somewhere sunnier.", "url": null, "source": "pwa", "author": "tagged", "created_at": "2026-10-19T15:52:20Z", "received_at": "2026-10-21T17:52:20.325Z", "blobs": []}], "removed": [], "tasks": {"done": 0, "total": 0}}, {"id": "01M5FSFDAP5E7JT46MP962NFV2", "slug": "scrap-design-notes", "title": "scrap design notes", "body": "# scrap design notes\n\nA running list of what the PWA should feel like. **Capture first**, read later.\n\n## Principles\n\n1. Quick capture never waits on an LLM.\n2. Originals are always kept.\n3. One tap for the common thing; the rest under *More*.\n\n## Open questions\n\n- [ ] Should Todos open on *Today* or *All*?\n- [x] Recent searches under the empty search box\n- [ ] A swipe to tick a todo off?\n\n## The capture path\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n  Phone -->|share| Queue[Offline queue]\n  Queue --> API[/api/captures/]\n  API --> DB[(SQLite)]\n  DB --> Ingest -->|Claude| DB\n```\n\n| Screen  | Primary action | Secondary |\n| ------- | -------------- | --------- |\n| Capture | Save           | Photo, Kind |\n| Todos   | New todo       | Filters |\n| Page    | Edit           | Share, Trash |\n\nInline `code`, a [link to the docs](https://gilesknap.github.io/scrap) and a footnote.[^1]\n\n> Chat is poor at showing images, so the PWA is where you look at things.\n\n```python\ndef capture(text: str) -> Page:\n    return store.save(text)\n```\n\n[^1]: Footnotes render at the end of the page.", "kind": "note", "kind_fixed": 1, "fields": {"personal": false}, "created_at": "2026-10-21T17:52:20.309Z", "updated_at": "2026-10-21T17:52:20.309Z", "due": null, "priority": null, "snoozed_until": null, "rev": 1, "tags": ["scrap", "scrap/design"], "captures": [{"id": "01M5FJKP2HM9S346Q3D25VT4F5", "kind": "note", "text": "# scrap design notes\n\nA running list of what the PWA should feel like. **Capture first**, read later.\n\n## Principles\n\n1. Quick capture never waits on an LLM.\n2. Originals are always kept.\n3. One tap for the common thing; the rest under *More*.\n\n## Open questions\n\n- [ ] Should Todos open on *Today* or *All*?\n- [x] Recent searches under the empty search box\n- [ ] A swipe to tick a todo off?\n\n## The capture path\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n  Phone -->|share| Queue[Offline queue]\n  Queue --> API[/api/captures/]\n  API --> DB[(SQLite)]\n  DB --> Ingest -->|Claude| DB\n```\n\n| Screen  | Primary action | Secondary |\n| ------- | -------------- | --------- |\n| Capture | Save           | Photo, Kind |\n| Todos   | New todo       | Filters |\n| Page    | Edit           | Share, Trash |\n\nInline `code`, a [link to the docs](https://gilesknap.github.io/scrap) and a footnote.[^1]\n\n> Chat is poor at showing images, so the PWA is where you look at things.\n\n```python\ndef capture(text: str) -> Page:\n    return store.save(text)\n```\n\n[^1]: Footnotes render at the end of the page.", "url": null, "source": "pwa", "author": "tagged", "created_at": "2026-10-21T15:52:20Z", "received_at": "2026-10-21T17:52:20.309Z", "blobs": []}], "removed": [], "tasks": {"done": 1, "total": 3}}], "drawings": {"01M5FBQYTHQ1NXW1RNJ47E65GH/81fdcce0010c5ab1c03ac3ed241595b321d55aa1db5caa10d6b9f5da34d79a15": {"current": {"id": 1, "version": 1, "producer": "human", "run_id": null, "author": "tagged", "created_at": "2026-10-21T17:52:20.706Z", "current": true, "superseded_at": null, "format": "scene", "restored_from": null, "data": {"format": "scene", "elements": [{"id": "e0", "type": "rectangle", "x": 180, "y": 200, "width": 300, "height": 150, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1000, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2000, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e10",